#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
==============================================================================
Circulous Shell (circulous-shell)
==============================================================================
Native macOS-Inspired Desktop Shell for Circulous Distribution.
Built with Python 3 and PyQt6.

Features:
- CirculousTopBar: Sleek macOS status bar with Circulous branding, active app title,
  global menus, CPU/RAM metrics pills, clock/date, and power options.
- CirculousDock: Floating glass dock with rounded capsule styling, app launchers,
  magnification hover effects, and active process indicators.
- CirculousLaunchpad: Full-screen overlay app launcher grid with live filter search.
- CirculousAboutDialog: Apple-style "About Circulous" system info panel.
- CirculousPowerDialog: Clean session control (Reboot / Shut Down / Logout).
==============================================================================
"""

